{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"rev-hero","type":"text","x":-260,"y":-560,"width":640,"height":150,"color":"3","text":"# Kovanica Revenue Engine (Non-Token)\n**6 Independent Revenue Streams · Zero Tracking Cookies · Live on `/pricing`**\n*Sustainable fiat & protocol-adjacent cashflow decoupled from KVNC price volatility.*\n\nFull details: [[11 - Revenue & Non-Token Monetization]] · [[00 - Kovanica Protocol MOC]]"},
		{"id":"s1","type":"text","x":-820,"y":-320,"width":360,"height":180,"color":"5","text":"### 1 · Managed RPC & Indexer SaaS\n- **Model:** Monthly API key tiers\n- **Pricing:** Free · `$49` Builder · `$249` Scale · Custom SLA\n- **Buyers:** dApps, wallets, bots, exchanges\n- **Surface:** `/pricing` + `/api-reference`"},
		{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":-400,"y":-320,"width":360,"height":180,"color":"3","text":"### 2 · RWA Issuer & Compliance SaaS\n- **Model:** B2B compliance subscription\n- **Pricing:** `$299` Launch · `$999` Institutional · White-Label\n- **Buyers:** Funds, real estate, bond issuers\n- **Surface:** `/wallet/rwa-issue` & `/wallet/rwa-manage`"},
		{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":20,"y":-320,"width":360,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"### 3 · Front-End Swap & Bridge Fee\n- **Model:** Optional hosted UX routing fee\n- **Pricing:** `0.00%` testnet · `0.15%–0.25%` mainnet (`VITE_SWAP_INTERFACE_FEE_BPS`)\n- **Buyers:** Retail & DeFi traders\n- **Surface:** `/swap`, `wallet-web`, `browser-extension`"},
		{"id":"s4","type":"text","x":440,"y":-320,"width":360,"height":180,"color":"5","text":"### 4 · Official Stratum Mining Pool\n- **Model:** Automatic block-reward pool fee\n- **Pricing:** `0%` testnet · `1.0%` mainnet (`VITE_MINING_POOL_FEE_PCT`)\n- **Buyers:** CPU/GPU miners & mining farms\n- **Surface:** `/pool` (`MinerCommandBuilder`)"},
		{"id":"s5","type":"text","x":-610,"y":-60,"width":440,"height":185,"color":"2","text":"### 5 · Verified Listings & Zero-Cookie Sponsors\n- **Verified Token Listing:** `$250` one-time contract/metadata check\n- **Verified RWA Issuer Badge:** `$500` compliance attestation\n- **Static Sponsor Banner:** `$400/mo` (`<SponsorSlot>` on `/faucet`, `/docs`, `/pricing`)\n- **Partner Referrals:** Hardware wallets & VPS (`https://` env-gated)"},
		{"id":"s6","type":"text","x":-90,"y":-60,"width":440,"height":185,"color":"6","text":"### 6 · Exchange & Enterprise Integration\n- **Exchange Onboarding:** From `$2,500` (node, PRO-21 deposit/withdraw)\n- **Custom Indexer Pipeline:** From `$1,500` (KVP-102/106 webhooks)\n- **SDK & Contract Advisory:** Retainer / fixed-scope sprints\n- **Buyers:** CEXs, custodians, enterprise builders"},
		{"id":"intake","type":"text","x":-220,"y":210,"width":560,"height":165,"color":"2","text":"### Live Billing, API Keys & Lead Intake (`kovanica-web#39`, `#40`)\n- `POST /api/billing/checkout` (Stripe Checkout or on-chain `USDC`/`KVNC` invoices)\n- `POST /api/billing/webhook` (HMAC-SHA256) → SHA-256 API keys (`data/api-keys.jsonl`) & `X-RateLimit-*` middleware\n- `POST /api/inquiries` (`data/inquiries.jsonl`) + `npm run inquiries:digest` PII-redacted admin CLI"}
	],
